a9458db434637a3473586.600x338.jpg?t=1770409696"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/3a079d1d1399a63f31d9f4b985a875a9bc1f1103/ss_3a079d1d1399a63f31d9f4b985a875a9bc1f1103.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770409696","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/3a079d1d1399a63f31d9f4b985a875a9bc1f1103/ss_3a079d1d1399a63f31d9f4b985a875a9bc1f1103.600x338.jpg?t=1770409696"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/e5bf18654c7f0500b30806e65f61b8e4a9249065/ss_e5bf18654c7f0500b30806e65f61b8e4a9249065.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770409696","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143910/e5bf18654c7f0500b30806e65f61b8e4a9249065/ss_e5bf18654c7f0500b30806e65f61b8e4a9249065.600x338.jpg?t=1770409696"}],"short_description":"You remove tattoos for a living. Every client comes with a tattoo they no longer want: symbols of once-eternal love, mistakes that refused to stay in the past, jokes that didn\u2019t age gracefully, and secrets asking to disappear. Make the past less permanent.","steam_appid":3143910,"support_info":{"email":"info@uraga.lt","url":"https://www.uraga.lt/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}